## Outcome

Enforce bounded redacted qualification evidence, verdict-specific retention, replay protection,
storage caps, and signature-preserving deterministic minimization. Accumulate and retain 100
closed lifecycles per operating-system fixture, prove semantic parity before provisional absolute
and same-target performance gates, and measure the 1,000-lifecycle and 100,000-history-row tier.

Run one fixed low-reasoning Tool Shed lifecycle per platform and prove artifact cardinality,
provenance, complete gate transfer, lineage, authority, revision accounting, resume idempotency,
final clean tails, and zero extra local or hosted rows.

## Completion Gate

